{"id":"01a03288-2574-757e-822a-bcf3b33ce7ee","issue_id":"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.5.2","event_type":"updated","actor":"Mark Atwood","old_value":"{\"id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.5.2\",\"title\":\"Python: Sequence exhaustion handling\",\"status\":\"in_progress\",\"priority\":1,\"issue_type\":\"task\",\"assignee\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"owner\":\"me@mark.atwood.name\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:46:29.599892Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"updated_at\":\"2026-08-24T06:44:58.338739Z\",\"started_at\":\"2026-08-24T06:44:58.338739Z\",\"lease_expires_at\":\"2026-08-24T06:49:58.338739Z\",\"heartbeat_at\":\"2026-08-24T06:44:58.338739Z\",\"dependencies\":[{\"issue_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.5.2\",\"depends_on_id\":\"project-LICHEN-worker6-l1qw.6.7.5\",\"type\":\"parent-child\",\"created_at\":\"2026-07-25T03:46:30.424579Z\",\"created_by\":\"Mark Atwood\",\"metadata\":\"{}\"}]}","new_value":"{\"notes\":\"Already implemented. Python sequence exhaustion handling is complete:\\n\\n1. OSCORE (crypto/oscore.py): Raises OverflowError at 40-bit limit. Constants: MAX_OSCORE_SEQUENCE_NUMBER, OSCORE_SEQUENCE_EXHAUSTED.\\n\\n2. Link-layer TX (link/link_layer.py): Raises OverflowError when 24-bit tuple (255, 65535) exhausted.\\n\\n3. Link-layer RX replay (link/replay.py): Issues warning at WRAPAROUND_WARNING_THRESHOLD. Rejects epoch rollover from 255 to 0.\\n\\n4. OSCORE Context Store: Has GenerationOverflowError at u32 generation max, SequenceReservationError for sender sequence exhaustion.\\n\\nAll exhaustion tests pass. Mirrors Rust SeqExhausted using Python OverflowError.\"}","created_at":"2026-08-24T06:49:38.420361Z"}
